---
title: How to create a person discussio
sidebar:
  order: 2
---
To start a personal discussion with an individual contact, follow these steps:

1. **Access the Discussions Section**
   - On the left-hand sidebar, click on the **Menu Icon** (1).
   - Select **Discussion** (2) from the menu to navigate to the discussion area.
1. **Initiate a New Discussion**
   - Click the **Plus Icon** (3) located in the top-right corner of the discussions list to create a new conversation.

![](image-198.png)

3. **Choose Conversation Type**
   - A modal window titled **Create a Conversation** will appear.
   - Select In **Person** as the conversation type to have a direct discussion with an individual contact.
1. **Select a Contact**
   - From the **Select a Contact** dropdown, search for and choose the contact you wish to start the conversation with.
   - Once selected, proceed with the conversation to begin the personal discussion.

![](image-199.png)

This process allows you to create and manage individual conversations with your contacts effectively within the discussion module.
